{"2650290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragon Hop", "steam_appid": 2650290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4764600], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dragon Hop</strong> is a challenging 3D <strong>precision platformer</strong> collectathon. Play as a dragon hatchling who got left behind in a strange world. Collect tokens to unlock abilities and appearances. Get stronger, climb higher and find clues that can give an explanation to the world around you. Try not to fall! </i><br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/ab8b95f9793197b6ff2bd06cc3dbced4.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/ab8b95f9793197b6ff2bd06cc3dbced4.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/ab8b95f9793197b6ff2bd06cc3dbced4.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you ready to prove yourself? Well, start <strong>climbing</strong>!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Falling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/cd3b4396f8e012a87825895ed6e6185e.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/cd3b4396f8e012a87825895ed6e6185e.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/cd3b4396f8e012a87825895ed6e6185e.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Hop is all about getting as high as you can get, to see all this world has to offer. Naturally, slipping, falling, and <strong>trying again</strong> plays a big part in that. Your journey will be hard, but there are ways for the keen-eyed and curious to make it easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/c8083928b0a96dc8b281579de1be02cd.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/c8083928b0a96dc8b281579de1be02cd.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/c8083928b0a96dc8b281579de1be02cd.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like exploring, in Dragon Hop you shall be greatly <strong>rewarded</strong>, as there are plenty of treasures scattered around the world, waiting for you to find them! Found a hidden door? There's likely a golden chest waiting on the other side. See a cave entrance? Time for spelunking! Who knows what kind of crystals may lie beneath the earth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/d95f2a4c6fea3bdc48ed3b834b6b55ec.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/d95f2a4c6fea3bdc48ed3b834b6b55ec.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/d95f2a4c6fea3bdc48ed3b834b6b55ec.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your pockets full of treasures? Well, it's time to use them! Speak with your dragon guide to exchange crystals and learn new <strong>skills</strong> for your dragon. Gliding? No problem! Spitting fireballs? Bring on the heat! Flying? If you just believe, there shall be nothing stopping you from touching the sky!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/f33ff746cdc38e9f7b10641dc4dd1441.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/f33ff746cdc38e9f7b10641dc4dd1441.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/f33ff746cdc38e9f7b10641dc4dd1441.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path shall not be easy. Sometimes a well-calculated jump will not be enough: you may have to dodge some nasty traps too! Be sure to keep on your feet in those moments, otherwise you could face a few setbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/00de570ec8ba26ca2aac8e10c6c69440.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/00de570ec8ba26ca2aac8e10c6c69440.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/00de570ec8ba26ca2aac8e10c6c69440.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some obstacles can move indeed, but some are straight up sentient! Watch out for these creatures. They are here to make your journey more difficult. Will you try to outsmart them or give them a taste of fiery heat? Up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/050bf0b928e13fb19b42c1745dc4d4bc.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/050bf0b928e13fb19b42c1745dc4d4bc.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/050bf0b928e13fb19b42c1745dc4d4bc.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a hard time hopping? See if you can use your environment to your advantage. From riding animals, to activating forgotten constructs - sailing boats to opening portals, never shy away from some exploring. Curiosity kills cats, not dragons! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here? What happened? What’s the point to any of this? These are great questions. Perhaps the answers don’t even matter, we could just be here for fun. But maybe…, just maybe there is more to this chaotic world than meets the eye. Let’s see if you can unravel the mystery…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a fan of hardcore platforming? Try Exploration mode! Dragon Hop aims to bridge the gap between those who like to suffer a bit and those who are just looking for a cosy ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Exploration mode you can look for Feathers to unlock checkpoints with, and save your progress. It’s good for some practice too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, should you choose Hardcore mode, you shall be rewarded with special appearances and additional achievements for your efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happy Hopping!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/2db634a07ba1da206d41f0d2bf04ae59.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dragon Hop</strong> is a challenging 3D <strong>precision platformer</strong> collectathon. Play as a dragon hatchling who got left behind in a strange world. Collect tokens to unlock abilities and appearances. Get stronger, climb higher and find clues that can give an explanation to the world around you. Try not to fall! </i><br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/ab8b95f9793197b6ff2bd06cc3dbced4.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/ab8b95f9793197b6ff2bd06cc3dbced4.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">