9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/050bf0b928e13fb19b42c1745dc4d4bc.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a hard time hopping? See if you can use your environment to your advantage. From riding animals, to activating forgotten constructs - sailing boats to opening portals, never shy away from some exploring. Curiosity kills cats, not dragons! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here? What happened? What’s the point to any of this? These are great questions. Perhaps the answers don’t even matter, we could just be here for fun. But maybe…, just maybe there is more to this chaotic world than meets the eye. Let’s see if you can unravel the mystery…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e26d8880332b8c630cfc3ee3c88aa6a1.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a fan of hardcore platforming? Try Exploration mode! Dragon Hop aims to bridge the gap between those who like to suffer a bit and those who are just looking for a cosy ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Exploration mode you can look for Feathers to unlock checkpoints with, and save your progress. It’s good for some practice too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.poster.avif?t=1783975364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.webm?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/e370e2ebfdcd13635c78a42527bf5287.mp4?t=1783975364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, should you choose Hardcore mode, you shall be rewarded with special appearances and additional achievements for your efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happy Hopping!</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Put your jumping skills to the test in this challenging precision platformer collectathon, playing as a dragon! Explore unique areas to find hidden treasures, collect crystals and trade them for skills to help you on your journey. Can you get to the top?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/ec5bea93793da2079fba604c77e5501cc7379af1/header.jpg?t=1783975364", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/224ae211bb7cf6564cc9cf0e96aaecb60d35ea8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783975364", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/224ae211bb7cf6564cc9cf0e96aaecb60d35ea8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783975364", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 Processor / AMD Athlon 3000G<br></li><li><strong>Mem